## No cookies on the public site

West of Mauritius does not set any cookies when you read the site and we do not use advertising or tracking cookies. That is why you do not see a cookie banner.

- **Language:** your language is part of the address (/en or /fr); nothing is stored in your browser for it.
- **Visitor statistics:** Umami counts visits without cookies and without personal data.
- **Maps:** the maps load images from OpenFreeMap and do not set cookies.

## Admin area

The editor who logs in to the administration area receives one strictly necessary cookie that keeps him signed in for up to eight hours. It is never set for visitors.

## If this changes

If we ever add a service that needs cookies we will ask for your permission first and update this page.
